Chapter: DiffusionResize
  cites Diffusion chapter Resize
  cites Diffusion chapter PthFile
  cites Kernel chapter GpuBridge
  cites Foreword chapter Console

 The fixture is build/resize-oracle.py's: Pillow's LANCZOS resizes of a 256 x
 192 picture. A resize agrees when every byte is Pillow's.

 We say:

Section: Arms

  count-same : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  count-same (a) (b) (i) (n) (acc) = if i >= n then acc else count-same a b (i + 1) n (acc + (if peek-byte a i == peek-byte b i then 1 else 0))

  arm : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Text
  arm (fx) (off) (ow) (oh) =
    let n = ow * oh * 3
    in let got = resize-lanczos fx 256 192 ow oh
    in let k = count-same got (fx + off) 0 n 0
    in "256 x 192 to " & show ow & " x " & show oh & ": " & (if k == n then "all " & show n & " bytes Pillow's" else show (n - k) & " of " & show n & " bytes differ")

  report : Integer -> [Console] Nothing
  report (fx) = act
    print-line-uni (arm fx 147456 384 288)
    print-line-uni (arm fx 479232 100 75)
    print-line-uni (arm fx 501732 256 150)
    print-line-uni (arm fx 616932 200 192)
    print-line-uni ("sabotage, 384 x 288 against the 100 x 75 fixture: " & show (22500 - count-same (resize-lanczos fx 256 192 384 288) (fx + 479232) 0 22500 0) & " of 22500 bytes differ")
  end

  opening : [Console] Integer
  opening = act
    report (pth-read "resize-lanczos.bin" 0 732132)
    let r = 0 in r
  end
